<title>USA: New York Times January ad volume rises.</title>
<headline>New York Times January ad volume rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Times Co said Friday its total advertising volume at its flagship newspaper, The New York Times, was up 4.6 percent in January.</p>
<p>At the Boston Globe newspaper, ad volume for that month was up 9.1 percent.</p>
<p>Ad volume at its regional newspaper group was up 2.2 percent in January.</p>
</text>
